W: Oh, Fathers, now our meeting is over; Fathers, we must part.
W: And if I never see you any more, I'll love you in my heart.
W:
W: And, we'll land on the shore; yes, we'll land on the shore.
W: Yes, we'll land on the shore and be free forever more.
W:
W: (Continues with sisters, brothers, mothers, and so on.)
